"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-09","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"不买号称能「治愈近视」「降低度数」的产品和服务"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-10","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"睡眠、作业、体育和排名都有明文规定，学校做不到可以提"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-11","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"孩子撑不住了可以休学，学籍学校必须给他留着，最长 1 年"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-12","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"查出视力不良，去医院做散瞳验光，之后按医生给的间隔复查"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-13","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"恒磨牙长出来以后做窝沟封闭"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-14","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"孩子爱打游戏，先看睡觉、作业和出门活动有没有被挤掉，别光盯着玩了多久"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-15","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"孩子说自己喜欢同性，别骂、别赶出家门、别送去「矫正」：家里的态度和他会不会自杀有关"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-16","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"管孩子别动手打，也别吼骂、骂他笨：常挨打挨骂的孩子，行为和情绪问题都更多"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-17","className":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"孩子难管、自己总忍不住打骂，去上一期教具体做法的家长课"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-18","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"别把孩子送进封闭管理的「戒网瘾学校」「特训营」：法律禁止用伤害身心的办法戒网瘾，已经有孩子被关死"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh,en,ru,es,ja,vi"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/30"},"children":["第 30 章 · 上学以后的孩子"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"30-17"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["17"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["证据 A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["孩子难管、自己总忍不住打骂，去上一期教具体做法的家长课"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["教家长具体管法的课，在抽签分配的试验里，孩子打人、不守规矩的问题少了，家长的情绪也好了。家长打骂孩子也少了，刚上完课时最明显，一两年后还在，但小了很多。上海也试过这类课，有效。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["学校、幼儿园和社区办的家长学校是公益的，不收费。有证据的那类课每周或隔周上一次，每次一到两小时，从四周到二十四周不等。回家要照着练。难在坚持上完、天天练。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Cochrane 汇总了 13 项试验，其中 10 项是抽签分组的，共 1078 名家长。孩子 3 到 12 岁，都有行为问题。上过课的家长，孩子的行为问题少了。家长自己评是 SMD −0.53（95% CI −0.72 到 −0.34，可信范围），旁人独立评是 −0.44（−0.77 到 −0.1…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：孩子难管、自己总忍不住打骂，去上一期教具体做法的家长课"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["学校、幼儿园和社区办的家长学校是公益的，不收费。有证据的那类课每周或隔周上一次，每次一到两小时，从四周到二十四周不等。回家要照着练。难在坚持上完、天天练。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Cochrane 汇总了 13 项试验，其中 10 项是抽签分组的，共 1078 名家长。孩子 3 到 12 岁，都有行为问题。上过课的家长，孩子的行为问题少了。家长自己评是 SMD −0.53（95% CI −0.72 到 −0.34，可信范围），旁人独立评是 −0.44（−0.77 到 −0.11）。SMD 和 d 是同一把尺子，0.5 算中等。家长的心理健康变好，−0.36（−0.52 到 −0.20）。负面或严厉的管法变少，家长自己评 −0.77（−0.96 到 −0.59），旁人评 −0.42（−0.67 到 −0.16）。作者说这些是短期效果。另一篇荟萃筛出 346 项抽签分组的试验，其中 60 项量了打骂孩子这类行为，分布在 22 个国家。打骂在课刚上完时少了，d = −0.46（−0.59 到 −0.33）。1 到 6 个月后是 −0.24（−0.37 到 −0.11）。7 到 24 个月后是 −0.18（−0.34 到 −0.02），越往后越小。这些数据大多是家长自己报的。国内也有试验。上海 81 名家长抽签分组，一部分上 Triple P 小组课。上完课，孩子的适应问题、家长的管法和情绪，都比等着上课的家长好，6 个月后还在。农村一所幼儿园有 191 名带孩子的大人参加，一部分自学网课，再加两次小组讨论。上完两周，他们报告的虐待孩子行为比只发书读的少约 33%（IRR 0.67）。三个月后，孩子的行为问题也少了（d = −0.40）。《家庭教育促进法》要求父母自觉学习家庭教育知识。中小学校、幼儿园可以办家长学校，定期组织公益性的家庭教育指导。居委会、村委会可以办社区家长学校。省级以上政府要开公益性的网上家长学校和服务热线。家庭教育指导机构不得组织营利性培训（全国，2022 年 1 月 1 日起施行）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Furlong M, McGilloway S, Bywater T, Hutchings J, Smith SM, Donnelly M. (2012). Behavioural and cognitive-behavioural group-based parenting programmes for early-onset conduct problems in children aged 3 to 12 years. Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews, (2), CD008225. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD008225.pub2","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1002/14651858.CD008225.pub2"]},"；Backhaus S, Leijten P, Jochim J, Melendez-Torres GJ, Gardner F. (2023). Effects over time of parenting interventions to reduce physical and emotional violence against children: a systematic review and meta-analysis. eClinicalMedicine, 60, 102003. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eclinm.2023.102003","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eclinm.2023.102003"]},"；Guo M, Morawska A, Sanders MR. (2016). A Randomized Controlled Trial of Group Triple P With Chinese Parents in Mainland China. Behavior Modification, 40(6), 825–851. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0145445516644221","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1177/0145445516644221"]},"；Wang W, Zhang H. (2026). A self-directed parenting program to reduce the risk of child maltreatment in rural China: A cluster randomized controlled trial. Child Abuse & Neglect, 173, 107937. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chiabu.2026.107937","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chiabu.2026.107937"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2021). 家庭教育促进法（第十八、二十五、三十一、三十八、四十条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817cac3b2d017cac5a6c6f0109","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8081817cac3b2d017cac5a6c6f0109"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["给 A 是因为有 Cochrane 和多项抽签试验合并出来的数字。试验里的课有几个共同点。带课的人教具体做法，比如陪孩子玩、夸奖、奖励和管教。家长在课上练习、演练，回家还有作业。只发资料或者只讨论的课被排除在外，所以证据管不到只听一场讲座的那种。国内公益家长学校讲什么、怎么讲，各地不一样，未必是这一类。挑课时看它是不是连上几周、让你练具体做法。课名里常见的有 Triple P、Incredible Years、亲子互动治疗（PCIT）。本书不推荐具体机构和收费产品。打骂少了的效果一两年后变小，课上完还得接着练。受益人是孩子，也是你自己。孩子已经有严重的情绪问题，带去精神科或儿童心理科，见本节第 8 条（抑郁筛查）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/30-16"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"管孩子别动手打，也别吼骂、骂他笨：常挨打挨骂的孩子，行为和情绪问题都更多"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/30-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"别把孩子送进封闭管理的「戒网瘾学校」「特训营」：法律禁止用伤害身心的办法戒网瘾，已经有孩子被关死"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["睡眠、作业、体育和排名都有明文规定，学校做不到可以提"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["文件写明，小学生每天睡 10 小时，初中 9 小时，高中 8 小时。小学上午上课一般不早于 8:20，中学不早于 8:00。2025 年又规定每天体育活动不少于…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子撑不住了可以休学，学籍学校必须给他留着，最长 1 年"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["休学有正式制度。父母或其他监护人提出申请，学校确认后报上级核准。一次最长 1 年，期满还要休就重新申请。休学期间学校要给孩子保留学籍，复学时回来接着上。具体办法…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["查出视力不良，去医院做散瞳验光，之后按医生给的间隔复查"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["散瞳验光是先滴一种眼药水，让眼睛里负责调焦的肌肉松下来，再验度数。这是在医院做的，诊断近视最准。卫健委写明这种药水对健康的眼睛不会造成损伤，停药后恢复正常。别拿…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-13"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["恒磨牙长出来以后做窝沟封闭"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["窝沟封闭是把大牙咬东西那一面的沟槽用树脂封住，食物残渣就塞不进去。做完两年，长蛀牙的机会约为不封的八分之一。不封时有 16% 的牙面会蛀，封了只有约 5%。四年…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子爱打游戏，先看睡觉、作业和出门活动有没有被挤掉，别光盯着玩了多久"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["真正够得上「游戏障碍」的，大约每百人里两三个。问卷门槛定得低、专挑青少年查，比例就会虚高。拿游戏公司的真实记录看，玩多玩少和心情好坏几乎没关系。未成年人按规定只…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/30-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["孩子说自己喜欢同性，别骂、别赶出家门、别送去「矫正」：家里的态度和他会不会自杀有关"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["国内中学生里，喜欢同性或者两性都喜欢的孩子，一年里试过自杀的约是别人的 3 到 5.5 倍。国外研究看到，青春期被家里强烈排斥的孩子，后来试过自杀的多得多。被父…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/30"},"children":["阅读整个主题：上学以后的孩子 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin"